option.FLOATING_ROCKS=Floating Rocks
option.FLOATING_ROCKS.comment=Slowly tumbling chunks of purple and blue stone scattered across the sky.
option.ROCK_AMOUNT=Rock Amount
option.ROCK_SIZE=Rock Size
option.SKY_HEADS=Sky Heads
option.SKY_HEADS.comment=On one random day in every few days, the floating rocks turn into giant floating heads at sunrise. They turn back into rocks at the next sunrise.
option.SKY_HEAD_DAYS=Head Day Every
option.SKY_HEAD_DAYS.comment=Days per cycle. One random day in each cycle is a head day. Set to 1 to see heads every day.
value.SKY_HEAD_DAYS.1=1 day
value.SKY_HEAD_DAYS.2=2 days
