value.SKY_HEAD_DAYS.7=7 days
option.GIANT_HEAD=Giant Head
option.GIANT_HEAD.comment=On head days, one enormous head rises over the southwest horizon at sunrise and sinks at the next one.
option.PORTAL_SPIN.comment=How fast the portal spins and pulls its clouds inward. 0 freezes it.

option.INK_OUTLINES=Ink Outlines
option.INK_OUTLINES.comment=Dark comic-book lines around the edges of blocks, mobs, and trees against what is behind them.
option.INK_STRENGTH=Ink Darkness
option.INK_WIDTH=Ink Width
option.INK_WIDTH.comment=Line width in screen pixels, also used for planet and rock outlines.
option.BLOCK_EDGES=Block Grid Lines
option.BLOCK_EDGES.comment=Faint dark lines along nearby block edges for a drawn, pixel-art look. 0 turns them off.
option.NEON_CAVES=Neon Caves
option.NEON_CAVES.comment=Amethyst glows cyan, pink, or lime per cluster, and ore flecks glow their own color.

