option.DREAM_TINT=Dream Tint
option.DREAM_TINT.comment=How strongly the purple-and-lime dream palette colors the sky, shadows, and highlights. 0 is natural.
option.FOLIAGE_VIBRANCE=Foliage Vibrance
option.FOLIAGE_VIBRANCE.comment=Pushes grass and leaves toward a lush lime green.
option.NIGHT_AURORA=Night Aurora
option.NIGHT_AURORA.comment=Soft lime-to-purple aurora ribbons on clear nights.
option.AURORA_STRENGTH=Aurora Strength
option.CLOUD_TINT=Cotton-Candy Clouds
option.CARTOON_CLOUDS=Cartoon Clouds
option.CARTOON_CLOUDS.comment=Replaces the blocky vanilla clouds with round, puffy clouds and a thick black outline. Cheap: drawn only on sky pixels.
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_AMOUNT=Cartoon Cloud Amount
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_AMOUNT.comment=How much of the sky is covered. Rain adds more.
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_HEIGHT=Cartoon Cloud Height
option.CARTOON_OUTLINE=Outline Thickness
option.CARTOON_OUTLINE.comment=Outline width in screen pixels. Stays the same thickness at any distance.
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_SIZE=Cartoon Cloud Size
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_SIZE.comment=How big each cloud is. Spacing scales with size so the sky keeps the same fullness.
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_VARIATION=Cartoon Cloud Height Variation
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_VARIATION.comment=How far each cloud floats above or below the base height, in blocks.
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_STYLE=Cartoon Cloud Style
option.CARTOON_CLOUD_STYLE.comment=Mixed uses all three: puffy clouds, tall towers that poke up, and long flat clouds in a higher layer.
value.CARTOON_CLOUD_STYLE.0=Mixed
